WEBVTT

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:07.700
Hikozaemon, thank you
for all of your help.

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:09.775
I'm all right now.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.106
M'Lord.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:14.738
| believe there is some sort of
an annual event being held today.

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:16.646
You may go nuts, if you like.

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:18.309
What are you saying?

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:21.650
Yes, it is true that |, Hikozaemon,
have always been a wild party animal...

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:25.954
...but we never know when Faust
might make another attempt on Japoness.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.960
| said you may go.

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:32.788
Baiko and Tamasaburo can fill your
shoes while you are gone.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.358
That is an order, old man!

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:38.427
Sir! Thank you kindly!

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:08.762
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:12.366
| was born to be with you.

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:15.709
The moment I awoke...

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:19.801
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:23.506
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:27.084
I was born to hold you.

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:30.257
Lies and truths...

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:34.384
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:39.129
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:40.967
...won't get to me.

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:44.496
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:48.064
...can be ours once again!

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:52.639
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:56.546
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:59.916
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:04.651
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:18.864
Welcome The New Year!
The Otaru Cup Marionette Contest

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:20.740
Take that!

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:22.666
Take that!

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:23.709
Take that!

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:25.206
Take that!

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:26.746
Back at you!

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:38.788
Come on in, everyone! It's ready!

00:02:41.294 --> 00:02:42.762
All right, it's chow time!

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:44.888
It's New Year's chow time!

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:46.363
I'm starving!

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:48.196
Where do you think you're going?!

00:02:48.268 --> 00:02:50.259
We still have a match to settle!

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.270
Go look in a mirror
before saying that!

00:02:52.906 --> 00:02:54.874
Ooh...!
(The loser's face gets painted on.)

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:56.809
One more match!

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:59.811
If I, Mitsurugi Hanagata, start off
the year by losing to a marionette...

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:04.112
...I won't be able to show my face
in public for the rest of the year!!

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:05.583
Now! NOW!

00:03:05.652 --> 00:03:08.587
All right already.
Here goes...

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:11.280
Have a nice spring!

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:13.325
SEE YOU NEXT FALL"

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:17.964
Cheers!

00:03:20.967 --> 00:03:24.870
Oh, YEAH!
This is a great New Year!

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:28.171
Even the Shogun is feeling better!

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:30.573
Here, Master Otaru! Say "ah"!

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:31.974
Ah!

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:33.570
How is it?

00:03:33.646 --> 00:03:35.114
Good!

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:37.912
Here, Otaru! Say "ah"!

00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:39.918
Please don't copy me!

00:03:39.986 --> 00:03:43.320
I'M the one who prepared
all of this, you know!

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.257
Yeah, yeah... You must be tired.

00:03:46.326 --> 00:03:49.421
Since you're so tired, I'll save
you the trouble of feeding him.

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:51.793
I don't THINK so!

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:54.890
I spent three days making
this just for Master Otaru!

00:03:56.002 --> 00:03:57.800
I'll let you do nothing of the sort!

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.463
What's that?!

00:03:59.539 --> 00:04:01.803
Here, Otaru! "AH"

00:04:05.345 --> 00:04:06.813
Is it good?

00:04:07.714 --> 00:04:09.705
- Don't be such a sneak!
- Please don't be such a sneak!

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:14.211
No fair, no fair, no fair!
| wanna feed Otaru, too!

00:04:14.354 --> 00:04:19.588
Very well, let's settle who gets
to feed Otaru the old-fashioned way!

00:04:19.659 --> 00:04:23.289
Honestly! Is that all you can
think of ? You're so uncivilized!

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:25.331
What was that,
Miss Hearts and Flowers?!

00:04:25.398 --> 00:04:26.695
Excuse me?!

00:04:34.007 --> 00:04:35.441
Now, now, now...

00:04:35.508 --> 00:04:37.636
That's no way to start the year...

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:40.245
Happy New Year!

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:42.179
Oh! Greetings!

00:04:42.248 --> 00:04:43.511
Otaru, have you seen this?

00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:46.416
The 12th Annual "New Year's Marionette Contest” on
January 8th! You ever thought of entering these guys?

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:48.881
Lime would be a shoo-in!

00:04:49.455 --> 00:04:52.015
Get lost! Bloodberry would
mop the floor with 'em!

00:04:52.091 --> 00:04:53.889
Nope, Cherry, all the way!

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.928
A marionette contest, huh?

00:04:57.297 --> 00:05:00.232
What's a "marionette contest," Otaru?

00:05:01.267 --> 00:05:03.793
It's where they gather the best
marionettes from around the world...

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:06.066
...and decide which one is the best.

00:05:06.205 --> 00:05:10.506
Hmm, that sounds interesting.
Let's settle our differences that way!

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:14.241
That's fine by me, although
it's clear who the winner will be!

00:05:16.015 --> 00:05:17.483
Me, too! Me, too!

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.609
- Is that acceptable, Master Otaru?
- Fine by you, Otaru?

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:22.688
Sure, go ahead!

00:05:22.755 --> 00:05:25.247
It sure beats having
a rumble inside the house.

00:05:25.325 --> 00:05:28.226
All right! We're THERE!

00:05:29.362 --> 00:05:32.923
I'll head over there right now
to register you in the contest!

00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:39.931
Listen closely!
Your current mission...

00:05:40.006 --> 00:05:42.737
...is to enter the
Marionette Contest!

00:05:43.876 --> 00:05:45.469
Us, sir?!

00:05:45.545 --> 00:05:48.412
We can't waste our time
on something so frivolous!!

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:51.712
Our goal is the capture of Japoness.

00:05:51.784 --> 00:05:55.118
But to do that, we must get
past those three marionettes.

00:05:55.822 --> 00:05:59.258
AND their acting commander,
Otaru Mamiya.

00:05:59.325 --> 00:06:00.520
Which means...

00:06:00.593 --> 00:06:03.324
Which means all we need to
do is kill Otaru Mamiya?

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:06.822
That would be
extraordinarily dumb.

00:06:06.899 --> 00:06:08.833
Just you try to snuff him out.

00:06:09.602 --> 00:06:13.163
Those three carry the same pointless
object inside them as you do...

00:06:13.239 --> 00:06:15.230
...known as a "maiden circuit."

00:06:15.308 --> 00:06:17.800
They would go on
an emotional rampage.

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:20.346
Remember the exploding
dummy fuhrer incident.

00:06:20.546 --> 00:06:24.813
Yes, sir. But, what does that have
to do with putting us in a contest?

00:06:25.385 --> 00:06:29.481
The three marionettes in question
will be taking part in that contest.

00:06:29.555 --> 00:06:32.081
Naturally, Otaru Mamiya
will be there as well.

00:06:32.625 --> 00:06:37.222
Your mission is to capture his heart,
and win him over to our side!

00:06:37.296 --> 00:06:40.266
And then, we will induct
him into our own army.

00:06:41.601 --> 00:06:44.969
I call it "The Super-Groovy
Go Get Otaru Mamiya” Plan!

00:06:45.271 --> 00:06:46.500
But, sir!

00:06:46.572 --> 00:06:50.873
Have you forgotten? Lord Faust
has given you over to me.

00:06:50.943 --> 00:06:54.573
In other words, an order from me
is an order from the fuhrer!!

00:06:56.649 --> 00:07:00.847
Fans of the International Marionette
Contest, good afternoon!

00:07:01.821 --> 00:07:06.054
The 12th Annual "New Year's Marionette Contest”
We are coming to you live from the Japoness Dome.

00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:09.959
Marionettes representing every country
of Terra ll have been gathered here...

00:07:10.029 --> 00:07:13.192
...today, to compare intelligence,
strength, and special talents...

00:07:13.266 --> 00:07:16.725
...to determine which marionette will
be elected this year's #1 marionette.

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:20.871
| am your commentator,
Hikozaemon Oekubo.

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:26.435
And, this year's guest is the hero
who saved Japoness, Mr. Otaru Mamiya.

00:07:27.313 --> 00:07:30.408
It is good to have you
with us today, Otaru.

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:32.840
My pleasure!

00:07:32.919 --> 00:07:35.286
Judging this contest, are pillars
of society from every country...

00:07:35.354 --> 00:07:38.255
...excluding Gartlant. Each
judge may give 1 to 10 points...

00:07:38.324 --> 00:07:42.192
...to each contestant per round who
will compete by their total score!

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:50.795
Thank you for your patience!
Without any further ado...

00:07:51.037 --> 00:07:55.804
...The 12th Annual New Year's
Marionette Contest will now commence!

00:07:56.275 --> 00:07:59.210
| am your announcer,
Mitsurugi Hanagata!

00:08:01.247 --> 00:08:04.273
And, now... Stage One!
As each contestant is introduced...

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:07.513
...they will exhibit their
unique appeal for the judges!

00:08:07.587 --> 00:08:10.818
<i>Thus said, let us begin!
Entry No At!</i>

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:13.322
Representing Japoness... LIME!

00:08:19.465 --> 00:08:21.729
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:08:21.801 --> 00:08:23.360
"GO, LIME!""
Lime! Lime!

00:08:23.769 --> 00:08:25.863
How's everybody doing??!

00:08:25.938 --> 00:08:28.669
GREAT!

00:08:29.976 --> 00:08:31.910
ME, TOO!

00:08:31.978 --> 00:08:35.846
Okay, now I'll show you
a little trick I can do!

00:08:36.282 --> 00:08:38.341
The Elephant Spin!!!

00:08:41.587 --> 00:08:44.352
It begins with a huge feat"

00:08:45.157 --> 00:08:46.852
Let's look to the judges!

00:08:46.926 --> 00:08:50.692
10, 10, 10, 10, 10...
All together, a score of 50 points!

00:08:50.897 --> 00:08:52.695
I did it, I did it, I did it"

00:08:53.366 --> 00:08:55.357
| can't do that...

00:08:55.434 --> 00:08:58.893
We aren't programmed
to perform stunts!

00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:03.400
None of this gutless talk!
No matter what it takes...

00:09:03.543 --> 00:09:07.411
...we must win Otaru Mamiya
over with our charms.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:09.412
Do you have a plan, Tiger?

00:09:10.016 --> 00:09:11.484
I do.

00:09:12.251 --> 00:09:14.185
Project "Sex Appeal.”

00:09:14.253 --> 00:09:16.381
-"Project...”
-"..Sex Appeal"?

00:09:16.622 --> 00:09:20.115
And, moving right along...
Entry No.2!

00:09:20.192 --> 00:09:22.854
Representing New Texas... JACQUELINE!

00:09:41.247 --> 00:09:43.443
Bang, bang!

00:09:43.516 --> 00:09:46.042
| just hit your heart!

00:09:58.564 --> 00:10:02.865
3,10, 10, 7, 10...
All together, a score of 40 points!

00:10:03.302 --> 00:10:06.761
Next, is... Entry No.3!

00:10:06.839 --> 00:10:09.604
Representing Japoness... CHERRY!

00:10:12.278 --> 00:10:15.304
Um... oh...

00:10:15.648 --> 00:10:18.140
"GO, GO, CHERRY!
You can do it, Cherry!!

00:10:18.918 --> 00:10:20.716
Yes!

00:10:21.654 --> 00:10:24.385
Now... I will sing for you!

00:10:24.457 --> 00:10:28.121
Frere Jacques, Frere Jacques...

00:10:29.328 --> 00:10:30.921
I was in error.

00:10:31.197 --> 00:10:33.325
What do you mean by that, Tiger?

00:10:33.833 --> 00:10:35.767
Otaru Mamiya...

00:10:35.835 --> 00:10:39.032
That Otaru Mamiya doesn't
respond to adult sex appeal!

00:10:39.105 --> 00:10:40.732
So, that's why!

00:10:40.806 --> 00:10:43.366
Luchs! You're up next.

00:10:43.442 --> 00:10:46.844
Portray the kind of
childish character he goes for.

00:10:46.912 --> 00:10:47.811
Roger.

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:52.308
And, now... Entry No.4!
Representing Xi'an...

00:10:52.918 --> 00:10:54.386
LIN LUNLUN!

00:10:54.453 --> 00:10:57.286
Lin, lin! Lun, lun!

00:10:57.356 --> 00:11:00.189
Wow! Look at all the people!

00:11:00.393 --> 00:11:02.361
They're all looking at me!

00:11:02.795 --> 00:11:04.763
I'm so embarrassed!

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:11.895
Do you like me, everybody?

00:11:15.207 --> 00:11:16.675
Tee-hee!

00:11:19.945 --> 00:11:22.505
| will now do a twisty dance!

00:11:22.581 --> 00:11:24.174
Twisty, twisty!

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:26.951
I-Is that what it takes, Tiger...?

00:11:27.253 --> 00:11:28.812
No freaking way...

00:11:28.888 --> 00:11:32.324
That's not childish,
that's just plain stupid.

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:38.793
1,1,2,1,1...
All together: 6 points!

00:11:39.198 --> 00:11:42.429
<i>On to the next contestant...
Entry No 5!</i>

00:11:42.501 --> 00:11:45.493
Representing Japoness... BLOODBERRY!

00:11:46.739 --> 00:11:49.140
Gather 'round!

00:11:49.208 --> 00:11:51.905
The bananas I have before me today are
bananas which are definitely bananas...

00:11:51.977 --> 00:11:54.742
...but not quite like any bananas
you have banana seen before!

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.005
"Our Lady Bloodberry"
Go, Bloodberry! Kick ass!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.914
They come from faraway Romana...

00:11:59.985 --> 00:12:02.545
...a summer resort land
of everlasting siestas!

00:12:02.621 --> 00:12:04.555
These are bananas among bananas...

00:12:04.623 --> 00:12:07.593
...ripened to perfection
in the hot jungle sun...

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:10.595
Listen, Panther...
Don't do ANYTHING.

00:12:10.896 --> 00:12:13.092
What do you mean, Tiger?

00:12:13.632 --> 00:12:16.260
If you speak a word,
you'll give yourself away.

00:12:16.335 --> 00:12:18.099
Just stand there
with your mouth SHUT.

00:12:19.672 --> 00:12:21.106
Fine.

00:12:21.674 --> 00:12:25.872
<i>Next, Entry No 6!
Representing Peterburg...</i>

00:12:25.945 --> 00:12:27.913
NINOTCHKA ELENOV!

00:12:37.289 --> 00:12:38.552
It seems to have worked.

00:12:38.624 --> 00:12:41.650
Yes, and look! Otaru Mamiya is
captivated along with the rest of them!

00:12:42.394 --> 00:12:47.093
7,8,6,10,9..
For a total of 40 points!

00:12:47.733 --> 00:12:50.259
And, that wraps up Stage One...

00:12:50.336 --> 00:12:53.067
...with Lime leading with 50 points!

00:12:53.139 --> 00:12:54.903
Care to give your predictions, Otaru?

00:12:54.974 --> 00:12:57.466
Hm? Oh, yes... Let's see...

00:12:58.010 --> 00:13:02.345
| can't wait to see
what will happen next!

00:13:15.294 --> 00:13:18.559
Now, Stage Two will be a cook-off!

00:13:18.798 --> 00:13:21.096
And the mystery theme is...

00:13:23.035 --> 00:13:24.525
RICE CAKE GUMBO!

00:13:24.603 --> 00:13:26.867
This year's theme
is rice cake gumbo!

00:13:27.072 --> 00:13:30.872
What a perfectly festive
theme for the New Year!

00:13:32.011 --> 00:13:34.503
A LA CUISINE!

00:13:37.416 --> 00:13:39.714
The Japoness representative, Cherry...

00:13:40.019 --> 00:13:42.283
...has started by
washing a dried bonito!

00:13:42.354 --> 00:13:44.152
How exceedingly proper!

00:13:45.124 --> 00:13:47.286
On Lime's end, however...

00:13:47.359 --> 00:13:49.327
...what is it that she is doing?

00:13:49.995 --> 00:13:52.464
She is juggling the rice cakes!

00:13:53.666 --> 00:13:57.330
There is applause from the stands!
Indeed, she is highly skilled!

00:13:57.403 --> 00:14:00.634
However, this has nothing
to do with cooking at all.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.634
On to Bloodberry,
what could she be up to?

00:14:04.043 --> 00:14:06.535
The table has her
completely hidden from view!

00:14:07.479 --> 00:14:10.642
Meanwhile, Ninotchka
representing Peterburg...

00:14:10.716 --> 00:14:13.083
...hasn't budged an inch
the entire time!

00:14:14.987 --> 00:14:17.456
You can stop that now. Get cooking!

00:14:17.523 --> 00:14:19.082
R-Right.

00:14:19.258 --> 00:14:23.126
Eek, scary!
The fishie is looking at me!

00:14:23.229 --> 00:14:24.287
Ooh!

00:14:24.363 --> 00:14:27.060
That goes for you, too. Get to it!

00:14:27.933 --> 00:14:29.401
Roger-...

00:14:30.536 --> 00:14:32.504
"Chili Pepper”

00:14:38.477 --> 00:14:40.502
It needs a little more OOMPH.

00:14:42.381 --> 00:14:43.849
That's it!

00:14:45.684 --> 00:14:48.278
I brought a little something
for a destructive tactic!

00:15:01.233 --> 00:15:02.200
Perfect!

00:15:02.468 --> 00:15:05.130
There are only three
minutes remaining!

00:15:05.337 --> 00:15:08.602
What could be the matter?
Lime still hasn't started yet!

00:15:09.475 --> 00:15:10.874
That's it!

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:16.847
Time's up!

00:15:16.916 --> 00:15:20.318
We will now start the judging!

00:15:20.386 --> 00:15:24.983
The rice cake gumbo sampling will begin
with Cherry, representing Japoness!

00:15:32.932 --> 00:15:35.697
Oo la la, this...
This is so smooth...

00:15:35.768 --> 00:15:39.204
...so full of body,
such a refined flavor...

00:15:39.405 --> 00:15:43.706
10, 10, 10, 10, 10...
All together, 50 points!

00:15:44.476 --> 00:15:47.673
Next up is Lime!
What could this be?

00:15:47.746 --> 00:15:50.716
She is setting an enormous
bowl before the judges...

00:15:51.383 --> 00:15:53.215
Oh, my goodness!

00:15:53.285 --> 00:15:56.118
Within the bowl,
is an entire elephant!

00:15:56.755 --> 00:16:01.056
The judges' surprise is obvious!

00:16:01.694 --> 00:16:04.527
Where could Lime be going with this?

00:16:04.596 --> 00:16:07.827
Otaru, can YOU come up
with an explanation?

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:11.936
Well, she boiled an elephant
to make... jumbo gumbo.

00:16:12.004 --> 00:16:16.100
She boiled Jumbo for gumbo!

00:16:16.175 --> 00:16:19.611
Boiled Jumbo makes Jumbo gumbo!

00:16:19.678 --> 00:16:22.272
I... see.

00:16:23.716 --> 00:16:26.515
And, how do the judges find it?

00:16:27.119 --> 00:16:31.716
7,8,9,7,8..
All together: 39 points!

00:16:32.024 --> 00:16:34.118
I don't know if it was
the element of surprise...

00:16:34.193 --> 00:16:35.991
...but Lime received high marks!

00:16:37.663 --> 00:16:38.892
Guts!

00:16:38.964 --> 00:16:41.695
Next up is Bloodberry...

00:16:41.934 --> 00:16:44.699
...but her rice cakes
are burnt to a cinder!

00:16:45.337 --> 00:16:49.205
1,2,1,1,1...
For a total of 6 points!

00:16:50.943 --> 00:16:52.911
You got a problem with that?!

00:16:53.379 --> 00:16:55.711
Next is Lin Lunlun
representing Xi'an...

00:16:55.781 --> 00:16:59.115
...who seems to have made the best
of the ingredients available...

00:16:59.184 --> 00:17:01.084
...but regrettably,
receives only 8 points.

00:17:01.353 --> 00:17:04.550
Ooh! That's so mean...!

00:17:04.757 --> 00:17:08.557
And, now... representing
New Texas, is Jacqueline!

00:17:17.036 --> 00:17:18.731
This is a HUGE score!

00:17:18.804 --> 00:17:21.830
Jacqueline secures 46 points!!

00:17:22.474 --> 00:17:27.173
And next, representing Peterburg,
is Ninotchka with the mysterious smile.

00:17:34.453 --> 00:17:37.286
Oh? What could have happened?

00:17:37.356 --> 00:17:40.951
The judges' seats have been
hidden by thick black smoke...

00:17:49.968 --> 00:17:52.630
Ninotchka receives the lowest
score with only 5 points!

00:17:54.339 --> 00:17:57.639
Stage Three, the final stage,
will be a scavenger hunt!

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:01.510
This is a race involving a snowboard
sprint around the frozen moat...

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:04.015
...to the relay point,
where they will each draw a card...

00:18:04.083 --> 00:18:08.020
...find the item on the card,
and then head for the goal!

00:18:12.624 --> 00:18:14.558
At this rate, Tiger...

00:18:14.626 --> 00:18:17.305
...you're the only one who
stands a chance of winning!

00:18:17.329 --> 00:18:21.823
Don't get the wrong idea.
Our goal is not to win the contest.

00:18:22.935 --> 00:18:26.530
Our goal is to get Otaru Mamiya!
To do that, we must use this race...

00:18:26.605 --> 00:18:30.337
...to impress him with our super-
grooviness, and sway him to our favor!

00:18:31.243 --> 00:18:32.836
Hey, you guys!

00:18:32.911 --> 00:18:35.243
Hit What's up?

00:18:35.314 --> 00:18:37.681
Haven't I seen you before?

00:18:38.016 --> 00:18:41.179
No... I'm sorry, dear,
but we've never met.

00:18:41.253 --> 00:18:43.585
- Have we, girls?
- Nope!

00:18:44.356 --> 00:18:46.848
Oh, really? I was so sure...

00:18:49.328 --> 00:18:50.853
On your marks!

00:18:50.929 --> 00:18:52.226
Get set!

00:18:56.602 --> 00:18:59.902
And, all of the marionettes
are off to a quick start!

00:19:05.577 --> 00:19:07.045
I'll show you!!

00:19:10.149 --> 00:19:11.480
Coming through"

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:13.985
Now I'M the grooviest!

00:19:25.697 --> 00:19:27.495
That hurts...

00:19:28.767 --> 00:19:30.735
I've had it with this!

00:19:31.336 --> 00:19:33.805
Now, I'm going to do it MY way"

00:19:43.315 --> 00:19:44.783
Eat THIS!

00:19:58.497 --> 00:20:01.330
Panther, you idiot"

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:06.228
Crap!

00:20:06.305 --> 00:20:08.831
| thought you guys
were a little unusual...

00:20:08.907 --> 00:20:11.399
So, it was you all along!

00:20:14.279 --> 00:20:17.271
It was the saber dolls!
What ingenious disguises!

00:20:17.849 --> 00:20:19.248
Blast!

00:20:19.318 --> 00:20:21.343
Those fools!

00:20:21.453 --> 00:20:23.444
Our cover is blown,
so we may as well mix it up!

00:20:23.522 --> 00:20:26.116
Commander Goddel!
Permission to change the plan!

00:20:26.658 --> 00:20:28.126
Return to base

00:20:28.961 --> 00:20:32.761
So, you can't even carry
out my flawless plan...?

00:20:32.831 --> 00:20:34.026
Return to base, at once!!

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.365
Tiger...

00:20:36.435 --> 00:20:39.302
You heard him. Luchs, Panther...

00:20:39.371 --> 00:20:40.839
Return to base!

00:20:42.341 --> 00:20:43.809
Iooo

00:20:43.875 --> 00:20:45.309
Don't...

00:20:45.377 --> 00:20:47.277
THINK so'!

00:20:56.355 --> 00:20:58.619
We'll get you for this!!

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:02.625
They did it!

00:21:02.694 --> 00:21:05.527
Our own saber marionettes,
the pride of Japoness...

00:21:05.597 --> 00:21:08.623
...have successfully repelled
the Gartlant saber dolls!!!

00:21:09.935 --> 00:21:13.462
Well, no one's here to stop us...

00:21:13.538 --> 00:21:15.506
...s0 let's settle our differences!

00:21:15.574 --> 00:21:17.042
Yeah!

00:21:21.346 --> 00:21:23.314
Otaru is mine!

00:21:23.382 --> 00:21:25.817
Master Otaru is mine!

00:21:25.884 --> 00:21:27.750
Otaru's MINE!

00:21:27.953 --> 00:21:28.977
Mine!

00:21:29.054 --> 00:21:29.850
MINE!

00:21:29.921 --> 00:21:30.979
Mine!

00:21:31.056 --> 00:21:32.285
| said, he's mine!"!

00:21:32.357 --> 00:21:33.791
Mine!

00:21:33.859 --> 00:21:35.486
Mine, mine, mine!!!

00:21:37.396 --> 00:21:40.024
Looks like I'm in for
another rough year.

00:21:40.165 --> 00:21:41.462
Hold it right there!!

00:21:41.533 --> 00:21:43.661
No way!

00:21:43.735 --> 00:21:45.203
You!

00:22:05.023 --> 00:22:08.755
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:08.827 --> 00:22:12.525
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:12.631 --> 00:22:15.532
Just think of me...

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:20.162
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:20.405 --> 00:22:24.171
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:24.242 --> 00:22:27.872
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:28.046 --> 00:22:31.778
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:31.850 --> 00:22:33.614
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:33.685 --> 00:22:37.644
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:39.758 --> 00:22:42.090
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:47.098
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:47.299 --> 00:22:50.894
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:51.103 --> 00:22:54.733
...one step at a time.

00:22:54.973 --> 00:22:58.603
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:58.677 --> 00:23:02.443
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:23:02.614 --> 00:23:06.175
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:06.518 --> 00:23:12.514
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:21.466 --> 00:23:22.627
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:22.701 --> 00:23:25.363
Hey, Grampa leyasu?
I've been thinking, and...

00:23:25.437 --> 00:23:28.168
...why is it that we're
living with Otaru?

00:23:28.573 --> 00:23:32.771
A great mission? Will something
big happen if we grow up?

00:23:33.445 --> 00:23:36.312
AH! The Japoness
Pioneer Museum is on fire!

00:23:36.381 --> 00:23:39.407
A treasure Grampa values more
than his life is in there!

00:23:40.452 --> 00:23:44.946
Revival Of The Females?! The Mystery
Of Lorelei Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:45.323 --> 00:23:47.348
I love you, Otaru!
